{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 85.79, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('spec:sample-task/specs/SPEC-001-create.md', 'spec', 'sample-task/specs/SPEC-001-create.md', 'SPEC-001 订单创建（既有行为，必须保持）', 'SPEC-001,SPEC-005', 'PATH: sample-task/specs/SPEC-001-create.md\\nKIND: spec\\nTITLE: SPEC-001 订单创建（既有行为，必须保持）\\n\\n# SPEC-001 订单创建（既有行为，必须保持）\\n\\n- 规格 ID：SPEC-001\\n- 类型：既有行为（回归约束）\\n- 关联代码：`sample-app/order_service/orders.py` → `create_order` / `VALID_STATUSES`\\n- 关联测试：`sample-app/tests/test_regression.py` 中创建相关用例\\n\\n## 需求\\n\\n`create_order(order_id, customer, amount, status=\\\"pending\\\")`：\\n\\n1. `order_id`、`customer` 必须是非空字符串；\\n2. `amount` 必须是大于 0 的有限数值；\\n3. `status` 必须是 `pending` / `paid` / `shipped` / `cancelled` 之一；\\n4. 缺省状态为 `pending`；\\n5. 校验失败抛出 `ValueError`。\\n\\n## 验收\\n\\n- 合法输入返回订单对象，字段与输入一致；\\n- 非法输入（空 id、空 customer、非正金额、未知状态）均抛出 `ValueError`。\\n\\n## 兼容性\\n\\n属于 SPEC-005 回归约束的一部分，本任务不得修改其行为。\\n', '81d640092bcfb4983cdebefbd4bf424d6cd6f769aca2625ee76e75c6f8d0ac5d', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 6.72, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('spec:sample-task/specs/SPEC-002-list-default.md', 'spec', 'sample-task/specs/SPEC-002-list-default.md', 'SPEC-002 订单列表：默认查询（既有行为，必须保持）', 'SPEC-002,SPEC-003,SPEC-004', 'PATH: sample-task/specs/SPEC-002-list-default.md\\nKIND: spec\\nTITLE: SPEC-002 订单列表：默认查询（既有行为，必须保持）\\n\\n# SPEC-002 订单列表：默认查询（既有行为，必须保持）\\n\\n- 规格 ID：SPEC-002\\n- 类型：既有行为（回归约束）\\n- 关联代码：`sample-app/order_service/orders.py` → `list_orders`\\n- 关联测试：`sample-app/tests/test_regression.py::test_list_orders_default_returns_all_in_creation_order`\\n\\n## 需求\\n\\n`list_orders(orders)` 在不传筛选/分页参数时：\\n\\n1. 返回全部订单，顺序与传入顺序一致（即创建顺序）；\\n2. 不修改传入的订单集合；\\n3. 返回新的列表对象，而不是原对象。\\n\\n## 验收\\n\\n- 传入 4 条订单，返回 4 条且 `order_id` 顺序不变；\\n- 返回列表与原输入不是同一个对象。\\n\\n## 兼容性\\n\\n本规格是 SPEC-003 / SPEC-004 的兼容基线：新增参数不得改变默认行为。\\n', '9fe13d29f6ae03ff2adb6dd89ce4b4ef32fd3182d049954a9240e9ead29d39da', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 24.61, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('spec:sample-task/specs/SPEC-003-filter.md', 'spec', 'sample-task/specs/SPEC-003-filter.md', 'SPEC-003 订单列表：按状态筛选（本任务新增）', 'SPEC-002,SPEC-003,SPEC-004', 'PATH: sample-task/specs/SPEC-003-filter.md\\nKIND: spec\\nTITLE: SPEC-003 订单列表：按状态筛选（本任务新增）\\n\\n# SPEC-003 订单列表：按状态筛选（本任务新增）\\n\\n- 规格 ID：SPEC-003\\n- 类型：新增需求（本任务要实现）\\n- 关联代码：`sample-app/order_service/orders.py` → `list_orders`\\n- 关联测试：`sample-app/tests/test_target_feature.py` 中的筛选相关用例\\n\\n## 需求\\n\\n`list_orders(orders, status=...)`：\\n\\n1. `status=None` 时行为与 SPEC-002 完全一致（返回全部、保持顺序）；\\n2. `status` 为合法状态（`VALID_STATUSES`：pending / paid / shipped / cancelled）时，\\n 只返回状态匹配的订单，且保持原有相对顺序；\\n3. `status` 不在 `VALID_STATUSES` 中时，抛出 `ValueError`；\\n4. 不修改传入的订单集合。\\n\\n## 验收\\n\\n- `status=\\\"paid\\\"` 只返回状态为 paid 的订单，顺序与创建顺序一致；\\n- `status=\\\"refunded\\\"`（非法值）抛出 `ValueError`；\\n- `status=None` 返回全部订单（与 SPEC-002 一致）。\\n\\n## 兼容性\\n\\n- 本规格不得改变 SPEC-002 的默认行为；\\n- 与 SPEC-004（分页）组合时，先筛选后分页。\\n', 'b6a58dbd8404343a140057a9a890d4ea2e07d7b86209ea0423e1ec396161f1c3', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 7.98, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('spec:sample-task/specs/SPEC-004-pagination.md', 'spec', 'sample-task/specs/SPEC-004-pagination.md', 'SPEC-004 订单列表：分页（本任务新增）', 'SPEC-002,SPEC-003,SPEC-004', 'PATH: sample-task/specs/SPEC-004-pagination.md\\nKIND: spec\\nTITLE: SPEC-004 订单列表：分页（本任务新增）\\n\\n# SPEC-004 订单列表：分页（本任务新增）\\n\\n- 规格 ID：SPEC-004\\n- 类型：新增需求（本任务要实现）\\n- 关联代码：`sample-app/order_service/orders.py` → `list_orders`\\n- 关联测试：`sample-app/tests/test_target_feature.py` 中分页相关用例\\n\\n## 需求\\n\\n`list_orders(orders, page=..., page_size=...)`：\\n\\n1. `page` 与 `page_size` 都为空时不分页，行为与 SPEC-002 一致；\\n2. 分页在筛选之后进行：先按 SPEC-003 过滤，再对结果切片；\\n3. `page` 为从 1 开始的整数；`page_size` 为 1～100 的整数（含边界）；\\n4. 以下情况抛出 `ValueError`：\\n - `page` 传入但小于 1 或不是整数；\\n - `page_size` 传入但小于 1、大于 100 或不是整数；\\n - 只传了其中一个参数（必须成对出现，除非两个都不传）；\\n5. 页码超出结果范围时返回空列表（不报错）；\\n6. 结果为空时返回空列表，不报错。\\n\\n## 验收\\n\\n- `page=2, page_size=2` 返回筛选结果的第 3、4 条；\\n- `page=9, page_size=2` 返回空列表；\\n- `page=0`、`page_size=0`、`page_size=101` 均抛出 `ValueError`；\\n- 不传分页参数时结果与 SPEC-002 一致。\\n\\n## 兼容性\\n\\n- 分页不改变筛选与默认查询行为；\\n- 不修改传入的订单集合。\\n', 'bb424986e781d7d328aa321848d0ffa136c492c2558b688379b3373b7acacac3', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 7.81, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('spec:sample-task/specs/SPEC-005-compatibility.md', 'spec', 'sample-task/specs/SPEC-005-compatibility.md', 'SPEC-005 订单服务其他既有行为（回归约束）', 'SPEC-005', 'PATH: sample-task/specs/SPEC-005-compatibility.md\\nKIND: spec\\nTITLE: SPEC-005 订单服务其他既有行为（回归约束）\\n\\n# SPEC-005 订单服务其他既有行为（回归约束）\\n\\n- 规格 ID：SPEC-005\\n- 类型：既有行为（回归约束，不得破坏）\\n- 关联代码：`sample-app/order_service/orders.py` → `create_order` / `advance_status` / `summarize_orders`\\n- 关联测试：`sample-app/tests/test_regression.py`\\n\\n## 需求\\n\\n1. `create_order(order_id, customer, amount, status=\\\"pending\\\")`：\\n - `order_id`、`customer` 非空字符串，否则 `ValueError`；\\n - `amount` 为大于 0 的有限数值，否则 `ValueError`；\\n - `status` 必须是 `VALID_STATUSES` 之一，否则 `ValueError`；\\n - 默认状态为 `pending`。\\n2. `advance_status(order, new_status)`：\\n - 状态流转按 `ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS`：pending→paid/cancelled，paid→shipped/cancelled，shipped/cancelled 为终态；\\n - 非法状态或非法流转抛出 `ValueError`；\\n - 返回新的 `Order`，不修改原对象。\\n3. `summarize_orders(orders)`：\\n - 返回 `count`、`total_amount`（保留 2 位小数）、`by_status`（包含全部状态，无订单为 0）；\\n - 空输入返回 count=0、total_amount=0、各状态计数为 0。\\n\\n## 验收\\n\\n- 修改前后，`sample-app/tests/test_regression.py` 全部通过；\\n- 不得通过修改预期结果或删除断言来让测试通过。\\n', '6d88990a6bcb981b159753670e5c3b8315c9a2c7713c05f63349178e35f38837', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 3.81, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('code:sample-app/order_service/__init__.py', 'code', 'sample-app/order_service/__init__.py', '代码：sample-app/order_service/__init__.py', '', 'PATH: sample-app/order_service/__init__.py\\nKIND: code\\nSYMBOLS: \\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"订单服务示例包。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom .orders import (\\n ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS,\\n VALID_STATUSES,\\n Order,\\n advance_status,\\n create_order,\\n list_orders,\\n summarize_orders,\\n)\\n\\n__all__ = [\\n \\\"ALLOWED_TRANSITIONS\\\",\\n \\\"VALID_STATUSES\\\",\\n \\\"Order\\\",\\n \\\"advance_status\\\",\\n \\\"create_order\\\",\\n \\\"list_orders\\\",\\n \\\"summarize_orders\\\",\\n]\\n', '8dc45fd6f2151ce876fd974fbd1b000c03b7af094c1eaf2420cd90e4be1a1be8', '2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00')"}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 11.99, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('code:sample-app/order_service/orders.py', 'code', 'sample-app/order_service/orders.py', '代码：sample-app/order_service/orders.py', 'Order,create_order,_is_int,_validate_pagination,list_orders,advance_status,summarize_orders', 'PATH: sample-app/order_service/orders.py\\nKIND: code\\nSYMBOLS: Order,create_order,_is_int,_validate_pagination,list_orders,advance_status,summarize_orders\\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"订单服务示例业务代码（SDD 上下文管理系统的“被修改对象”）。\\n\\n对应规格见 ``sample-task/specs/``。``list_orders`` 已实现 SPEC-003（按状态筛选）\\n与 SPEC-004（分页），其余函数提供题目要求的“原有行为”，保持不变（SPEC-005）。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nfrom __future__ import annotations\\n\\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass, field, replace\\nfrom datetime import datetime, timezone\\nfrom typing import Iterable\\n\\n# SPEC-001：订单状态取值\\nVALID_STATUSES: tuple[str, ...] = (\\\"pending\\\", \\\"paid\\\", \\\"shipped\\\", \\\"cancelled\\\")\\n\\n# SPEC-005：状态流转规则（既有行为）\\nALLOWED_TRANSITIONS: dict[str, set[str]] = {\\n \\\"pending\\\": {\\\"paid\\\", \\\"cancelled\\\"},\\n \\\"paid\\\": {\\\"shipped\\\", \\\"cancelled\\\"},\\n \\\"shipped\\\": set(),\\n \\\"cancelled\\\": set(),\\n}\\n\\n\\n@dataclass(frozen=True)\\nclass Order:\\n \\\"\\\"\\\"一条订单记录。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n order_id: str\\n customer: str\\n amount: float\\n status: str = \\\"pending\\\"\\n created_at: datetime = field(default_factory=lambda: datetime.now(timezone.utc))\\n\\n def as_dict(self) -> dict:\\n \\\"\\\"\\\"返回用于展示/序列化的字典。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n return {\\n \\\"order_id\\\": self.order_id,\\n \\\"customer\\\": self.customer,\\n \\\"amount\\\": self.amount,\\n \\\"status\\\": self.status,\\n \\\"created_at\\\": self.created_at.isoformat(),\\n }\\n\\n\\ndef create_order(\\n order_id: str,\\n customer: str,\\n amount: float,\\n status: str = \\\"pending\\\",\\n) -> Order:\\n \\\"\\\"\\\"创建订单（SPEC-001）。\\n\\n - order_id / customer 必须是非空字符串\\n - amount 必须是大于 0 的有限数值\\n - status 必须是 VALID_STATUSES 之一\\n \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n if not isinstance(order_id, str) or not order_id.strip():\\n raise ValueError(\\\"order_id must be a non-empty string\\\")\\n if not isinstance(customer, str) or not cu..."}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 7.55, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('test:sample-app/tests/test_regression.py', 'test', 'sample-app/tests/test_regression.py', '测试：test_regression.py', '_sample_orders,test_create_order_defaults_to_pending,test_create_order_rejects_invalid_input,test_list_orders_default_returns_all_in_creation_order,test_advance_status_happy_path,test_advance_status_rejects_illegal_transition,test_advance_status_allows_cancel_from_pending_and_paid,test_summarize_orders,test_summarize_empty_orders,test_valid_statuses_are_the_expected_set', 'PATH: sample-app/tests/test_regression.py\\nKIND: test\\nSYMBOLS: _sample_orders,test_create_order_defaults_to_pending,test_create_order_rejects_invalid_input,test_list_orders_default_returns_all_in_creation_order,test_advance_status_happy_path,test_advance_status_rejects_illegal_transition,test_advance_status_allows_cancel_from_pending_and_paid,test_summarize_orders,test_summarize_empty_orders,test_valid_statuses_are_the_expected_set\\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"既有行为回归测试（SPEC-001 / SPEC-002 / SPEC-005）。\\n\\n这些用例在代码修改前后都必须全部通过，用于证明本次修改没有破坏原有行为。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport pytest\\n\\nfrom order_service import (\\n VALID_STATUSES,\\n advance_status,\\n create_order,\\n list_orders,\\n summarize_orders,\\n)\\n\\n\\ndef _sample_orders():\\n return [\\n create_order(\\\"o1\\\", \\\"alice\\\", 10.0, \\\"pending\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o2\\\", \\\"bob\\\", 20.5, \\\"paid\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o3\\\", \\\"carol\\\", 30.0, \\\"paid\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o4\\\", \\\"dave\\\", 40.25, \\\"shipped\\\"),\\n ]\\n\\n\\ndef test_create_order_defaults_to_pending():\\n order = create_order(\\\"o1\\\", \\\"alice\\\", 9.9)\\n assert order.status == \\\"pending\\\"\\n assert order.amount == 9.9\\n assert order.order_id == \\\"o1\\\"\\n assert order.customer == \\\"alice\\\"\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\n \\\"kwargs\\\",\\n [\\n {\\\"order_id\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"customer\\\": \\\"alice\\\", \\\"amount\\\": 1.0},\\n {\\\"order_id\\\": \\\"o1\\\", \\\"customer\\\": \\\" \\\", \\\"amount\\\": 1.0},\\n {\\\"order_id\\\": \\\"o1\\\", \\\"customer\\\": \\\"alice\\\", \\\"amount\\\": 0}..."}
{"ts": "2026-10-29T10:55:46+08:00", "elapsed_ms": 7.81, "rows": 0, "sql": "REPLACE INTO sdd_documents (doc_id, kind, path, title, symbols, content, content_sha, updated_at) VALUES ('test:sample-app/tests/test_target_feature.py', 'test', 'sample-app/tests/test_target_feature.py', '测试：test_target_feature.py', '_sample_orders,test_filter_returns_only_matching_status,test_filter_preserves_creation_order,test_filter_rejects_unknown_status,test_pagination_applies_after_filter,test_pagination_keeps_default_order_without_filter,test_pagination_page_beyond_range_returns_empty_list,test_pagination_validates_page,test_pagination_validates_page_size,test_status_and_pagination_combined_with_empty_result,test_default_call_behavior_unchanged', 'PATH: sample-app/tests/test_target_feature.py\\nKIND: test\\nSYMBOLS: _sample_orders,test_filter_returns_only_matching_status,test_filter_preserves_creation_order,test_filter_rejects_unknown_status,test_pagination_applies_after_filter,test_pagination_keeps_default_order_without_filter,test_pagination_page_beyond_range_returns_empty_list,test_pagination_validates_page,test_pagination_validates_page_size,test_status_and_pagination_combined_with_empty_result,test_default_call_behavior_unchanged\\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"目标功能测试（SPEC-003 / SPEC-004）。\\n\\n本次代码修改的目标：为 ``list_orders`` 实现按状态筛选与分页。\\n这些用例在修改前应当失败（功能未实现），修改后必须全部通过。\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\nimport pytest\\n\\nfrom order_service import create_order, list_orders\\n\\n\\ndef _sample_orders():\\n \\\"\\\"\\\"按创建顺序 o1..o5；其中 paid 状态的是 o2、o3。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n return [\\n create_order(\\\"o1\\\", \\\"alice\\\", 10.0, \\\"pending\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o2\\\", \\\"bob\\\", 20.0, \\\"paid\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o3\\\", \\\"carol\\\", 30.0, \\\"paid\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o4\\\", \\\"dave\\\", 40.0, \\\"shipped\\\"),\\n create_order(\\\"o5\\\", \\\"erin\\\", 50.0, \\\"paid\\\"),\\n ]\\n\\n\\ndef test_filter_returns_only_matching_status():\\n result = list_orders(_sample_orders(), status=\\\"paid\\\")\\n assert [o.order_id for o in result] == [\\\"o2\\\", \\\"o3\\\", \\\"o5\\\"]\\n\\n\\ndef test_filter_preserves_creation_order():\\n result = list_orders(_sample_orders(), status=\\\"paid\\\")\\n order_ids = [o...."}
